<view class="screen purchase-screen"><view wx:if="{{testCheckout}}" class="notice">支付联调 · 真实小额扣款；热量与营养数值为估算，动作演示视频尚未开放。</view><view class="eyebrow">你的选择，成为你的安排</view><view class="title">从你的生活，<text>{{'\n'}}</text>练出自己的薄肌。</view><view wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="tag">{{plan.title}}</view><view class="body-copy">{{plan.direction}}</view><view wx:if="{{plan.assessment.schemaVersion===3}}" class="hero"><view class="task-title">目标体重 {{plan.assessment.targetWeight}} 千克</view><view wx:if="{{plan.energyTargets}}" class="body-copy">{{plan.energyTargets.direction==='loss'?'减重':plan.energyTargets.direction==='gain'?'增重':'维持'}} · {{plan.energyTargets.note}}</view>
<button wx:for="{{paceRows}}" wx:key="value" class="secondary" data-pace="{{item.value}}" bindtap="changePace" disabled="{{busy}}"><view>{{item.label}}{{item.selected?' · 已选择':''}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.targets}}" class="fine">{{item.targets.direction==='maintain'?'维持体重':item.targets.estimatedWeeks?'预计 '+item.targets.estimatedWeeks+' 周':'建议分阶段复评'}} · 摄入 {{item.targets.intakeKcal}} 千卡/日 · 活动约 {{item.averageActivity}} 千卡/日（周均）</view><view wx:else class="fine">热量目标暂未启用</view></button>
<view class="field-label">每日步数目标</view><input type="number" value="{{stepGoal}}" bindinput="stepInput"/><button class="link" bindtap="saveSteps" disabled="{{busy}}">更新步数目标</button><view wx:if="{{vm.stepsReference!==null && vm.stepsReference!==undefined}}" class="fine">近期完整日期平均 {{vm.stepsReference}} 步，仅作参考</view>
<button wx:if="{{vm.isMember && vm.entitlement}}" class="secondary" bindtap="applyTargets" disabled="{{busy}}">保存目标，今日生效</button></view><navigator wx:else class="secondary" url="/pages/assessment/index">补充目标体重与步数</navigator>
<view class="section-title">为什么这样安排</view><view wx:for="{{plan.reasons}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice">{{item}}</view><view class="section-title">你的第一周</view><view wx:for="{{plan.days}}" wx:key="index" class="list-row"><text class="mono">0{{index+1}}</text><view class="grow"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.nutrition}}</view></view></view>
<view class="section-title">你的一天，会这样被指导</view><view class="hero"><view class="task-title">三餐不必重来，从搭配开始</view><view wx:for="{{plan.nutrition.meals}}" wx:key="*this" class="body-copy">{{item}}</view><view class="muted">{{plan.nutrition.scene}}</view><view class="body-copy">{{plan.nutrition.alternative}}</view><view class="fine">{{plan.nutrition.note}}</view><view wx:if="{{plan.nutrition.numericEnabled || plan.nutrition.reviewed}}" class="tag">估算每日 {{plan.nutrition.energy}} 千卡 · 蛋白质 {{plan.nutrition.protein}} 克</view></view>
<view class="section-title">居家训练，有动作也有指导</view><view wx:for="{{plan.days}}" wx:key="index"><view wx:if="{{!item.rest}}" hidden="{{index !== firstTraining}}"><view wx:for="{{item.exercises}}" wx:for-item="move" wx:key="id" class="exercise-row"><view class="task-title">{{move.name}} · {{move.sets}} 组 × {{move.reps}} 次</view><video wx:if="{{move.media}}" src="{{move.media}}" controls="true" object-fit="contain"/><view class="body-copy">{{move.cue}}</view><view class="muted">降低难度：{{move.alternative}}</view></view><view class="notice">{{item.short}}</view></view></view>
<block wx:if="{{!testCheckout}}"><view class="section-title">忙起来，也有人帮你想办法</view><view class="hero"><view class="fine">指导对话示例，非你的真实对话</view><view class="body-copy">你：今天只有 10 分钟，还要练吗？</view><view class="muted">教练：先做熟悉动作的简化练习，记录实际完成情况。无需为了补练打乱明天。</view><view class="body-copy">你：午餐只能点外卖怎么办？</view><view class="muted">教练：按你的饮食偏好选择主食、蛋白质和蔬菜，检查禁忌，再把酱汁另放。</view></view>
</block><view class="section-title">选择持续指导的时间</view><button wx:for="{{catalog}}" wx:key="sku" data-sku="{{item.sku}}" bindtap="select" class="package {{sku===item.sku?'package-selected':''}}"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>¥{{item.price}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{testCheckout}}" class="body-copy"><text wx:if="{{iosTestCheckout}}">iOS 目前仅开放月度 ¥1 测试。</text>测试套餐用于验证到账、基础方案和执行记录。金额为真实扣款，无自动续费；付款成功起算测试权益有效期。</view><view wx:else class="body-copy">三档功能相同：完整饮食训练计划、每周复评、AI 每天 30 次成功回复。手动续购，无自动扣费。付款成功起算有效期。</view><view class="fine">薄肌是长期积累的方向；身体变化因人而异，不承诺统一结果或达成时间。订单与退款可联系客服；苹果设备的退款请通过 Apple 的购买记录申请。</view><view wx:if="{{!checkoutAvailable}}" class="notice">指导服务正在准备中，暂不收款。你的评估与预览已保留。</view><view wx:if="{{purchaseIssue}}" class="notice">{{purchaseIssue}}</view><button wx:if="{{purchaseIssue || !checkoutAvailable}}" class="secondary" bindtap="refreshPurchase" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新购买状态</button><navigator wx:if="{{vm.pendingOrderId}}" class="secondary" url="/pages/orders/index">有待确认订单，查看状态</navigator><button class="contact" open-type="contact" binderror="contactError">购买与服务咨询</button>
<view class="purchase-bar"><text>¥{{price}} · 无自动续费</text><button class="primary" bindtap="buy" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || purchaseIssue || !checkoutAvailable}}">{{checkoutAvailable?(testCheckout?'支付并验证基础方案':'开启我的指导'):'服务暂未开放'}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">先完成评估，再看看适合你的安排。<navigator class="primary" url="/pages/assessment/index">设计我的薄肌计划</navigator></view></view>
